In AWS, there are mainly 4 types of Load Balancers under Elastic Load Balancing (ELB):

1. Application Load Balancer (ALB) - Layer 7

✅ Routes traffic based on URL path, hostname, headers, query strings.

Real-time Example

Imagine you're running an e-commerce website:

www.shop.com/products  → Product Server
www.shop.com/payments  → Payment Server
www.shop.com/orders    → Order Server


ALB can route requests like:

/products → EC2 Group A
/payments → EC2 Group B
/orders   → EC2 Group C

Companies Use It For
E-commerce websites
Web applications
Microservices
REST APIs

Interview One-Liner:

ALB is used for HTTP/HTTPS applications where routing decisions are based on URLs or hostnames.

2. Network Load Balancer (NLB) - Layer 4

✅ Routes traffic based on TCP, UDP, TLS.

Real-time Example

Suppose you have an online gaming application.

Players connect using:

TCP Port 443
UDP Port 5000


NLB forwards traffic with very low latency.

Companies Use It For
Online gaming
Banking applications
Trading platforms
High-performance applications

Interview One-Liner:

NLB is used when ultra-high performance and low latency are required.

3. Gateway Load Balancer (GWLB)

✅ Used to deploy and scale security appliances.

Real-time Example

Company traffic flow:

Internet
   ↓
Firewall
   ↓
IDS/IPS
   ↓
Application Servers


GWLB distributes traffic across multiple firewalls.

Companies Use It For
Firewalls
Intrusion Detection Systems (IDS)
Security inspection
Interview One-Liner

GWLB is used to load balance security appliances such as firewalls and intrusion detection systems.

4. Classic Load Balancer (CLB) - Legacy

✅ Older generation load balancer.

Real-time Example

Suppose an old application has:

EC2-1
EC2-2
EC2-3


CLB distributes traffic among them.

Companies Use It For
Legacy applications
Older AWS environments
Interview One-Liner

CLB is the older AWS load balancer and is generally replaced by ALB or NLB for new deployments.

Easy Comparison
Load Balancer	Layer	Best For	Example
ALB	Layer 7	Websites & APIs	Amazon shopping site
NLB	Layer 4	High-speed TCP/UDP apps	Online gaming app
GWLB	Security Layer	Firewalls & IDS	Enterprise security setup
CLB	Layer 4/7	Legacy apps	Old EC2 applications

Real-World Architecture Example

For a shopping website:

Users
  ↓
Application Load Balancer
  ↓
EC2 Web Servers
  ↓
RDS Database


For a bank:

Users
  ↓
Network Load Balancer
  ↓
Banking Servers


For a corporate network:

Internet
  ↓
Gateway Load Balancer
  ↓
Firewall Fleet
  ↓
Application Servers

AWS Exam Tip
Website/API → ALB
TCP/UDP & Low Latency → NLB
Firewall/Security → GWLB
Old Legacy Setup → CLB
